<Events>
    <!--Campaign: Amthor. Created by Sil taTener-->
	<Warlord side="1" name="Agnoril" city="Drakh-Agar" level="10" portrait="32" major="2" minor="0">
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="2" name="Kirin" city="Kirin" level="15" portrait="33" major="3" minor="3">
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="3" name="Nordman" city="Pamir" level="10" portrait="29" major="0" minor="3">
	</Warlord>

    <!--Story start-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="1"/>
		<Message>你重返白色山脉。深深吸进一口寒冷而清新的空气，|复仇的念头再次涌上心头。这回，你是猎人，|而且绝非孤身一人。你的不死族同伴早已渴望猎物。|卡兹·阿加尔坐落在东方的高山背后。你派出斥候，开始集结第一梯队。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="agnoril"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="dragon"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="empire"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="dwarves"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="reinforcement"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="story"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="scouts"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="3"/>
		<Message>第一批斥候归来了。帝国正在边境地区集结兵力，|你必须提防来自南方的顽强抵抗。</Message>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="5"/>
		<Message>斥候从卡兹·阿加尔返回。那里依旧满目疮痍，|他们没发现阿格诺里尔王子的踪迹。不过，|他们听说矮人已将德拉克·阿加尔定为新首都，|据称它位于东南方。</Message>
	</Event>

    <!-- Scouts -->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="18">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="18"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="scouts"/>		
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="24">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="24"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="scouts"/>		
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="scouts"/>
		<Message>你找到了几名斥候……然而他们都已死去。|尸体上的痕迹让你确信：附近有巨龙出没！</Message>
	</Event>

    <!-- Elementar -->
	<Event side="1" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="10"/>
                <Action type="unit" data1="16" data2="1" data3="26" string1="Twin Elementar"/>
                <Action type="unit" data1="16" data2="1" data3="26" string1="Twin Elementar"/>
	</Event>

    <!-- 25.1 Dragon not dead and reinforcement-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ge" data1="25" String1="story"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="dragon"/>
		<Message>希安特拉抵达首都，面容因忧虑而憔悴。|“古老的火龙基林一路紧追我们。|新一窝幼龙很快就要孵化了。我们必须改变计划。”</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="reinforcement"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="2" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="9">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="reinforcement"/>
                <Action type="unit" data1="52" data2="5" data3="3"/>
                <Action type="unit" data1="49" data2="3" data3="6"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="2" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="9">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="5"/>
                <Action type="unit" data1="52" data2="1" data3="3"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="2" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="9">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="10"/>
                <Action type="unit" data1="52" data2="1" data3="6"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="2" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="9">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="15"/>
                <Action type="unit" data1="52" data2="1" data3="9"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="2" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="9">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="20"/>
                <Action type="unit" data1="52" data2="1" data3="10"/>
	</Event>



    <!-- 25.1.1 Dragon not dead and prince agnoril not dead -->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ge" data1="25" String1="story"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="dragon"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="agnoril"/>
		<Message>怒火在你心中升腾：“改变计划？”|精灵直视你的双眼，那股奇异的酥麻感又来了。“没错！我们必须先收拾那些蜥蜴，杀死基林！”|她转身欲走，你却迅速伸手，将她牢牢拉住。“亲爱的，要不要再给我们的计划添些援军？”她轻蔑地瞥了你一眼。“你是统帅……而我……”|突然，她脸上绽出一抹笑容：“我会教你一道有用的法术……”</Message>
		<Action type="spell" data1="20"/>
		<Action type="mana_crystals" data1="4"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="story"/>
	</Event>

    <!-- 25.1.2 Dragon not dead and prince agnoril dead -->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ge" data1="25" String1="story"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="dragon"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="agnoril"/>
		<Message>怒火在你心中升腾：“改变什么计划？|阿格诺里尔王子已经死了！|我在他脖子上找到了这枚护符。你知道是谁给他的吗？|”|精灵直视你的双眼，那股奇异的酥麻感又来了。“这是龙族的手艺！”</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="story"/>
	</Event>



    <!-- 25.2 Dragon dead and prince agnoril not -->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ge" data1="25" String1="story"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="dragon"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="agnoril"/>
		<Message>希安特拉抵达首都，面带忧色：|“那头古老的火龙基林……你有它的消息吗？|我听说它一直在跟踪我们！”|怒火在你心中升腾：“斥候，你来得太迟了！那些蜥蜴都死了，可基林还是逃走了。”</Message>
		<Message>精灵直视你的双眼，你的脑海深处骤然传来一阵剧痛。|“再也别叫我斥候！统帅！”|她挥了挥手，剧痛随之退去。随后，她微微一笑：“找到阿格诺里尔王子之后，派个使者来见我！”</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="story"/>
	</Event>


    <!--Warlord Dragon -->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="9">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="9"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="agnoril"/>
		<Message>你攻占了龙族首都，但基林逃走了。|搜遍堡垒，你仍找不到任何线索，无法解释这头古龙为何一路追踪你。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="dragon"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="9">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="9"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="agnoril"/>
		<Message>你攻占了龙族首都，但基林逃走了。|搜遍堡垒，你仍找不到关于那枚护符的任何线索。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="dragon"/>
	</Event>

    <!--Warlord Dwarves -->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="0"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="empire"/>
		<Message>你击败了德拉克·阿加尔的矮人，摧毁了元素双子。|但阿格诺里尔王子逃往了边境地区。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="dwarves"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="0"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="empire"/>
		<Message>你击败了德拉克·阿加尔的矮人。|阿格诺里尔王子的尸体就躺在你面前。|他为何要杀死你的父亲和家中其他亲人？|你搜查尸体，发现一枚奇异的小护符。正想从他颈上取下链子，手指刚触及冰冷金属，电流便猛地窜过全身。刹那间，空气中充满了电光。</Message>
		<Message>毫无疑问，这是一件威力惊人的魔法神器。|阿格诺里尔王子一直受它的魔力支配！|你怒不可遏。必须查出究竟是谁制作了这件神器，又是谁把它交到王子手上！</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="dwarves"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="agnoril"/>
	</Event>

    <!--Warlord Empire-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="3">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="3"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="dwarves"/>
		<Message>你终于击败了帝国。|如今德拉克·阿加尔的矮人孤立无援，|阿格诺里尔王子也失去了藏身之处。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="empire"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="3">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="3"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="dwarves"/>
		<Message>你击败了帝国，阿格诺里尔王子的尸体就躺在你面前。|他为何要杀死你的父亲和家中其他亲人？|你搜查尸体，发现一枚奇异的小护符。正想从他颈上取下链子，手指刚触及冰冷金属，电流便猛地窜过全身。刹那间，空气中充满了电光。</Message>
		<Message>毫无疑问，这是一件威力惊人的魔法神器。|阿格诺里尔王子一直受它的魔力支配！|你怒不可遏。必须查出究竟是谁制作了这件神器，又是谁把它交到王子手上！</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="empire"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="agnoril"/>
	</Event>

    <!--Warlord Win Option-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="3">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="agnoril"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="dragon"/>
		<Message>你再一次征服了白色山脉，夺回祖先的故乡。|可占据你心头的并非骄傲，而是疑虑。|你必须查明那枚魔法护符究竟扮演了什么角色。古龙基林是唯一的线索，它似乎也牵涉这场阴谋。|接下来进入《阿姆索尔 08》……</Message>
		<Action type="victory" data1="0"/>
	</Event>


    <!--Story Trigger-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="30" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="dwarves"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ne" data1="0" String1="story"/>
		<Action type="counter_add" data1="1" String1="story"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="30" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="empire"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ne" data1="0" String1="story"/>
		<Action type="counter_add" data1="1" String1="story"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="30" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="dragon"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ne" data1="0" String1="story"/>
		<Action type="counter_add" data1="1" String1="story"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="30" location="city" locdata="22">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ne" data1="0" String1="story"/>
		<Action type="counter_add" data1="1" String1="story"/>
	</Event>

</Events>
